Oct 2026 21:40:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/iran-currency-rial-dollar-record-low-blockade-oil-revenue-payments/</guid></item><item><title>佐兰·马姆达尼 (Zohran Mamdani) 表示，现在要实现美国梦，“你必须在某些方面运气好”，而且许多人认为中彩票的几率更大</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/zohran-mamdani-luck-american-dream-lottery-affordability-crisis-housing/</link><description>“人们认为买彩票的几率比自己中奖的几率更大。这对我们生活的国家意味着什么？” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2298397225-e1791049050239.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 19:02:52 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/zohran-mamdani-luck-american-dream-lottery-affordability-crisis-housing/</guid></item><item><title>Tony Elumelu：非洲的年轻企业家有伟大的想法。他们需要的是资金和商业支持</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/africa-entrepreneurs-early-stage-capital-jobs/</link><description>据世界银行统计，每年有10至1200万非洲年轻人进入劳动力市场，但仅创造了约300万个正式就业岗位。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TOE-05.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/africa-entrepreneurs-early-stage-capital-jobs/</guid></item><item><title>项目设计者预测，“真正富有的美国人会因为没有阿根廷护照而感到尴尬”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/argentina-golden-passport-wealth-americans-embarrassed-not-to-have-it/</link><description>努里·卡茨 (Nuri Katz) 帮助创建了投资公民计划，但他认为这是第一个将避风港与巨大商机结合起来的计划。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297626034-e1791043926501.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 16:32:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/argentina-golden-passport-wealth-americans-embarrassed-not-to-have-it/</guid></item><item><title>评级机构警告称，由于利息成本飙升，而选举增加了债务上限的风险，美国债务日益受到市场的摆布</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/us-debt-mercy-bond-market-interest-costs-treasury-yields-midterm-election-debt-ceiling/</link><description>“这一轨迹表明中期财政路径不可持续，并使主权国家越来越容易受到市场情绪和融资条件变化的影响。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2295408157-e1791042578738.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 17:15:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/us-debt-mercy-bond-market-interest-costs-treasury-yields-midterm-election-debt-ceiling/</guid></item><item><title>FlyDubai 副驾驶使用驾驶舱的防撞斧试图夺取飞行控制权，但由于担心极端主义观点而被阿曼禁止飞行</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/flydubai-copilot-cockpit-crash-axe-israel-flight-oman-extremist-views/</link><description>副驾驶已被确认为哈马姆·哈马米 (Hamam al-Hammami)。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-2297340387-e1791039203813.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:02:47 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/flydubai-copilot-cockpit-crash-axe-israel-flight-oman-extremist-views/</guid></item><item><title>多莉·帕顿 (Dolly Parton) 的图书计划覆盖了七分之一的美国 5 岁以下儿童。还要持续多久？</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/dolly-parton-books-for-kids-imagination-library/</link><description>至少有四个州出现了资金挑战，帕顿基金会现在负责该计划。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-925002586.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 15:00:50 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/dolly-parton-books-for-kids-imagination-library/</guid></item><item><title>麦肯锡：人工智能创造的就业机会将多于它杀死的就业机会——在消灭了 1100 万人之后</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/ai-job-displacement-creation-new-careers-11-million-americans-workforce-mobility/</link><description>只有七分之一的失业工人可以直接获得不断增长的工作，而医疗保健和建筑领域的大多数新工作都无法远程完成。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GettyImages-50379000.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 03 Oct 2026 08:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/10/03/ai-job-displacement-creation-new-careers-11-million-americans-workforce-mobility/</guid></item></channel></rss>